# Synthesis of Fe/Co bimetallic metal–organic framework‐derived composites and their enhanced electromagnetic wave absorption

Jae Ryung Choi1,2 · Eunyeong Cho1,3 · Horim Lee1 $\cdot\cdot$ Sang‐Bok Lee1 · Woong‐Ryeol $\Upsilon\mathbf{u}^{2}$ · Jeonghun Kim3   
Hee Jung Lee1   
Received: 20 July 2023 / Revised: 7 December 2023 / Accepted: 22 December 2023 / Published online: 5 February 2024   
